WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.030
In this short tutorial,

2
00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:06.664
you schedule a report so that it reaches
your team every Monday morning,

3
00:00:06.714 --> 00:00:09.160
without anyone opening Beacon Reports.

4
00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:15.210
Open the report you want to send. In the
top-right corner, select Schedule.

5
00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:20.050
Under Recipients, type each email address
and press Enter.

6
00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:22.250
The address appears as a chip.

7
00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:25.100
Recipients don't need a Beacon account.

8
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:29.900
Choose how often the report is sent, the
day, and the time.

9
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.740
The time is shown in your own time zone.

10
00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:39.370
Choose the format: PDF for a report people
read, Spreadsheet for one they work with.

11
00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:44.390
Then select Preview to see the subject
line and the attachment's name.

12
00:00:44.990 --> 00:00:47.220
Select Save schedule.

13
00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:52.020
A message confirms the schedule and names
the next delivery.

14
00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:56.090
The Schedules tab lists it, with Edit and
Pause beside it.

15
00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:57.090
You're done.
